[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12421.309, "timestamp": "03:27:01", "text": "比如那种10美元的……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12424.83, "timestamp": "03:27:04", "text": "一切都是因为我想做得更多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12427.99, "timestamp": "03:27:07", "text": "因为自己做会很困难。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12431.91, "timestamp": "03:27:11", "text": "所以，我觉得喜欢比较好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12435.67, "timestamp": "03:27:15", "text": "最好还是用现成的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12439.51, "timestamp": "03:27:19", "text": "尤其是 Twitch 广告插件。我有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12442.55, "timestamp": "03:27:22", "text": "嗯，我添加了。我只需要补充一点："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12446.15, "timestamp": "03:27:26", "text": "公开喊话和切割统计数据"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12450.03, "timestamp": "03:27:30", "text": "东西。那两样东西。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12453.55, "timestamp": "03:27:33", "text": "是的。但那会是件好事。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12457.19, "timestamp": "03:27:37", "text": "美好的。我身处普通的酒吧吗？我觉得我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12459.87, "timestamp": "03:27:39", "text": "是的，我去的是普通的酒吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12461.63, "timestamp": "03:27:41", "text": "好的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12465.15, "timestamp": "03:27:45", "text": "她花了5000元预算为我买东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12477.75, "timestamp": "03:27:57", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12479.15, "timestamp": "03:27:59", "text": "从某种意义上说，我明白了。"}]